# imported from LocRU_Maslyonok_anims (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:605
msgid ""
"Quest Item: A letter given to you by Arion Hunter for delivery to the Dread Pirate Stanley on Regna."
msgstr ""
"Предмет с заданием: Письмо, данное вам Арионом Хантером для доставки Ужасному Пирату Стенли на Регну."

# imported from LocRU_Maslyonok_anims (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:605
msgid "Report"
msgstr "Донесение"

# imported from LocRU_Maslyonok_anims (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:606
msgid ""
"Quest Item: A funerary urn entrusted to your care by the Troll, Overdune Snapfinger. It contains the ashes of his brother, Vilebite."
msgstr ""
"Предмет с заданием: Погребальная урна, которую доверил вам тролль Овердюн Пальцелом. Содержит прах его брата."

# imported from LocRU_Maslyonok_anims (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:606
msgid "Urn of Ashes"
msgstr "Урна с прахом"

# imported from LocRU_Maslyonok_anims (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:607
msgid "Brazier"
msgstr "Светильник"

# imported from LocRU_Maslyonok_anims (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:607
msgid ""
"Quest Item: This brazier emanates the unsettling vibrancy of dark magic. It smells strongly of pitch and sulfur."
msgstr ""
"Предмет с заданием: Светильник испускает неизвестные эманации темной магии. От него сильно пахнет серой."

# imported from LocRU_Maslyonok_anims (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:608
msgid "Dragon Leader's Egg"
msgstr "Яйцо Предводителя Драконов"

# imported from LocRU_Maslyonok_anims (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1452 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2097 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:608
msgid "Egg"
msgstr "Яйцо"

# imported from LocRU_Maslyonok_anims (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:608
msgid ""
"Quest Item: This Dragon egg is nearly ready to hatch. The small life inside makes its presence known with an occasional rustle."
msgstr ""
"Предмет с заданием: Это яйцо Дракона вот-вот проклюнется. Маленькое существо внутри заявляет о своем присутствии шорохами и стуками."

# imported from LocRU_Maslyonok_anims (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:609
msgid "Heart of Fire"
msgstr "Сердце Огня"

# imported from LocRU_Maslyonok_anims (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:609 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:610 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:611
