# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/npc_topic_text_patch.txt:15
msgid ""
"The Grandmaster of Ascension, William Smithson, instructs from his home on the eastern island of the Evenmorn Islands."
msgstr ""
"Великий мастер вознесения Вильям Смитсон учит у себя дома на восточном острове архипелага Эвенморн."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/content/npc_topic_text_patch.txt:16
msgid "I can teach you Expert Alchemy if you meet the requirements."
