# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:1060
msgid ""
"Seraphim: Mind adds <good>{school_damage}</> damage to each blow, growing with Might, weapon speed and the weapon's damage multiplier."
