# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:1163
msgid ""
"Regenerates <good>{hp_regen:1}</> hit points per second; twice that 20 seconds after the last hit taken, four times more again with no enemy near."
