#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:893
#| msgid ""
msgid ""
"Current cover chance: <good>{cover_chance}</> %. Mastery comes by itself at <value>{ladder_expert}</>, <value>{ladder_master}</> and <value>{ladder_grandmaster}</> points. The gem beside its name on the skills page (or P) switches it: {cover_state}."
msgstr ""
"Текущий шанс прикрытия: <good>{cover_chance}</> %. Мастерство приходит само на <value>{ladder_expert}</>, <value>{ladder_master}</> и <value>{ladder_grandmaster}</> пунктах. Камень рядом с названием на странице умений (или P) переключает его: {cover_state}."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:898
#| msgid ""
msgid ""
"Now each spell point absorbs <mana>{mana_efficiency:2}</> damage. The gem beside its name on the skills page (or M) switches it: {mana_shield_state}."
