# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/ruleset.yml:63
msgid ""
"Larger groups and better loot. Attacking while flying ends Fly on most maps."
msgstr ""
"Группы крупнее, добыча лучше. Атака в полете на большинстве карт прерывает Полет."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/ruleset.yml:66
msgid "As Hard; melee monsters outdoors can also gain a ranged attack."
